{"id":"657893","name":"煎艾叶粄","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/657893/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"艾叶","amount":"250g"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"粘米粉","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小苏打","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"把糯米粉和粘米粉混合放盆里。","img":"images/657893/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"水烧开倒入艾叶。","img":"images/657893/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入一勺小苏打。","img":"images/657893/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮软后捞出过凉水。","img":"images/657893/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"攥干水分。","img":"images/657893/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入入破壁机，加上开水和糖。","img":"images/657893/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅碎。","img":"images/657893/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"打好的青汁倒入粉内。","img":"images/657893/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"和成团。","img":"images/657893/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"揪出几块放水里煮。","img":"images/657893/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"面团浮起后捞出。","img":"images/657893/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入生面团里继续揉。","img":"images/657893/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"揉好的面团。","img":"images/657893/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"揪出一块搓圆，再拍成饼状。","img":"images/657893/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"凉水入锅蒸15分钟。","img":"images/657893/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"蒸好的青粄。","img":"images/657893/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放凉后入锅煎一煎更好吃。","img":"images/657893/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"两面煎至微黄即可。","img":"images/657893/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。软糯清香，非常好吃。","img":"images/657893/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}